<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97847" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκοινων-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>have a joint share of</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς δόξης ταύτης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					57.2
				</span></i>
			; <i>to be connected with</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς κνήμης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Art.</u>
					85
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τινί τινος</span>
			<i>go shares with</i> one <i>in</i> a thing, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				162.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in
			<u>NT</u>c. dat., <i>take part in, have fellowship
			with</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῖς ἁμαρτίαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Apoc.</u>
					18.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς ἔργοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ep.Eph.</u>
					5.11
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. μου τῇ θλίψει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ep.Phil.</u>
					4.14
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
